{"id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-ring.md","title":"Ring","display":"df-ring — Ring","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ring","aliases":["58-df-ring","Ring"],"display":"df-ring — Ring","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ring"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ring</span><span>Ring</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ring — Ring"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md\">../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"788f4256d9b974d6\" href=\"?note=788f4256d9b974d6\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md\">../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,a,b,c\\in V\">\\(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,a,b,c\\in V\\)</span> (ring parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S\\)</span> (abelian-group predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md\">../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ring}_S,\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Ring}_S,\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S\\)</span> (ring predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ring} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(R,+)\\land 0_R\\in R\\land\\forall a\\in R\\;(0_R+a=a=a+0_R)\\land(\\cdot:R\\times R\\to R)\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in R\\;((a\\cdot b)\\cdot c=a\\cdot(b\\cdot c))\\land1_R\\in R\\land\\forall a\\in R\\;(1_R\\cdot a=a=a\\cdot1_R)\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in R\\;\\bigl(a\\cdot(b+c)=a\\cdot b+a\\cdot c\\land(a+b)\\cdot c=a\\cdot c+b\\cdot c\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ring} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(R,+)\\land 0_R\\in R\\land\\forall a\\in R\\;(0_R+a=a=a+0_R)\\land(\\cdot:R\\times R\\to R)\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in R\\;((a\\cdot b)\\cdot c=a\\cdot(b\\cdot c))\\land1_R\\in R\\land\\forall a\\in R\\;(1_R\\cdot a=a=a\\cdot1_R)\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in R\\;\\bigl(a\\cdot(b+c)=a\\cdot b+a\\cdot c\\land(a+b)\\cdot c=a\\cdot c+b\\cdot c\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ring} \\vdash \\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land \\forall a,b\\in R\\;(a\\cdot b=b\\cdot a)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ring} \\vdash \\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land \\forall a,b\\in R\\;(a\\cdot b=b\\cdot a)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The convention here is a unital ring; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_R\">\\(0_R\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_R\">\\(1_R\\)</span> are explicitly tied to the two operations.</li>\n<li>Field: commutative ring where nonzero elements form abelian group under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\">\\(\\cdot\\)</span></li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Z}, \\mathbb{Z}/n\\mathbb{Z}, k[x]\">\\(\\mathbb{Z}, \\mathbb{Z}/n\\mathbb{Z}, k[x]\\)</span>, matrix rings</li>\n<li>Noetherian: every ideal is finitely generated</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Dummit and Foote, Abstract Algebra</li>\n<li>Lang, Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md","status":"resolved","id":"788f4256d9b974d6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S$ (abelian-group predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,a,b,c\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ring}_S,\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ring} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(R,+)\\land 0_R\\in R\\land\\forall a\\in R\\;(0_R+a=a=a+0_R)\\land(\\cdot:R\\times R\\to R)\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in R\\;((a\\cdot b)\\cdot c=a\\cdot(b\\cdot c))\\land1_R\\in R\\land\\forall a\\in R\\;(1_R\\cdot a=a=a\\cdot1_R)\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in R\\;\\bigl(a\\cdot(b+c)=a\\cdot b+a\\cdot c\\land(a+b)\\cdot c=a\\cdot c+b\\cdot c\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ring} \\vdash \\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land \\forall a,b\\in R\\;(a\\cdot b=b\\cdot a)","display":true},{"tex":"0_R","display":false},{"tex":"1_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{Z}, \\mathbb{Z}/n\\mathbb{Z}, k[x]","display":false}],"bytes":1522,"backlinks":[{"id":"a0a1c48294b2e248","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ring}_S$ (unital-ring predicate; see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]])"},{"id":"c3c066df70468180","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ring}_S,\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]])"},{"id":"081edc5d75e10718","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ring}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]])"},{"id":"0ad886c6bc35a838","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)$（环，see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]）"},{"id":"108885c3887e8986","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S$ (commutative-ring predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]])"},{"id":"85a2ae5fb67dda7f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e6a1ed8511f909f2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,x,r,I,\\mathfrak m\\in V\\land\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)$ (see [[58-df-ring]])"},{"id":"5faf0467ca9c794e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"完整图、消解圈、交叉顺序及立方体边使用 [[58-df-k